          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo gilata liatua tenebo ine wueji sinyati neeta ake nabo kikenet naidikidiko katitin are. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neeta nena kikeneta imatuan are imatuan are naamanaa too yeneta te pooki kikenet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore te nena kikeneta e ilo gilata neguetakino ilkerubi o ltuka, anaa lelo ooguetakino nena sunta; netii ilkeek kumok oonukita ilo gilata lioriong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 41:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Netii ilusien enchoto e ilo gilata too nkaloli pokira, neikodoki nena sunta too lkeek loltukai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.41.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.41.26"
            ]
          }
        }
